#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:145
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "After November 1, 2024, the student and citizen movement in Serbia talked in Viber groups, spread the word on Instagram and gathered sign-ups with forms and spreadsheets. Potok grew out of an overview of those eighteen apps and services and of what they offer."
